  - id: 3336
    name: "T\xF2a C7"
    description: "T\xF2a nha\u0300 C7 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng c\xF4ng tr\xECnh
      hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i v\xE0 quy m\xF4 nh\u1EA5t t\u1EA1i \u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc
      B\xE1ch khoa H\xE0 N\u1ED9i. C\xF3 t\u1ED5ng di\u1EC7n t\xEDch kho\u1EA3ng
      40.000 m2, v\u1EDBi h\xECnh d\xE1ng ch\u1EEF E (Electrical- Electronic Engineering)
      ho\u0103\u0323c ch\u1EEF M (Mechanical Engineering) l\xE0 n\u01A1i l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c
      c\u1EE7a Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0110i\u1EC7n - \u0110i\u1EC7n t\u1EED v\xE0 Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      C\u01A1 kh\xED. "
    thumb: {fileID: 2800000, guid: dd45ad4b53a397b499e74b04ffbe8d73, type: 3}
    gridWidth: 9
    gridHeight: 7
